{"name": "nights/berserk-c80-p02", "created": 1789559907.121228, "updated": 1789560181.562258, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.5, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "turn": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "root": "9ad7aa56", "current": "abe4c10e", "nodes": {"9ad7aa56": {"id": "9ad7aa56", "parent": null, "kind": "root", "text": "corrections to the residents' edition\n\npage 8, third line. for east read west. the gate has not been moved.\npage 19, footnote. for widow read wife. the certificate arrived after printing.\npage 31, second paragraph. delete the sentence beginning nobody remembers. we have received a letter.\npage 44. the blank space is of the correct dimensions and should not be filled by hand.\n\nseveral copies have been returned with the same correction on page 45. in each case\n", "ts": 1789559907.121226, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": null}, "a1a7dfd0": {"id": "a1a7dfd0", "parent": "9ad7aa56", "kind": "model", "text": "the word is incorrectly inserted, so we hope it will be clear without any amendment.\nwe would welcome news of other corrections.\nin future please check your proofs carefully and return them", "ts": 1789559910.599285, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bi