ore attention to the development", "ts": 1789559919.615978, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "the man who had a daughter that had a bad name but you didn't say it in the book. you should have.", "why": "I think it might be true of my daughter. —", "used": "opus"}}}, "ea4778a9": {"id": "ea4778a9", "parent": "9ad7aa56", "kind": "model", "text": "it has been made with an automatic typewriter which indicates a mistake, or possibly a misprint, on page 80 where a double quote is omitted at the end of", "ts": 1789559922.632473, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "9d2bc328": {"id": "9d2bc328", "parent": "9ad7aa56", "kind": "model", "text": "this was a copy printed early, before the type was corrected.\nwe have now checked the remaining copies and can assure readers that no more copies will come back with this mistake.\n", "ts": 1789559952.038053, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predict