: {"id": "3f8e3952", "parent": "9ad7aa56", "kind": "model", "text": "this correction is unnecessary.\nthe price is now reduced to two dollars per copy, with postage free to residents in the United States.", "ts": 1789559958.842238, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 28, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "ffb25c78": {"id": "ffb25c78", "parent": "9ad7aa56", "kind": "model", "text": "this correction has been made without consulting us. if it was necessary at all it would be\nmade when a fresh impression is called for.\n\ncorrections to the new edition", "ts": 1789559961.8478131, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "1e8dcee0": {"id": "1e8dcee0", "parent": "c88c5d4a", "kind": "model", "text": "\nof the theory of numbers in the pages to come. while the editor of the mathematical magazine\nfeels that it may be impossible to fulfil all these requests in this period", "ts": 1789559978.903053, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 